<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">

<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>CI/CD Deployment Sukses!</title>
  <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
</head>

<body class="bg-gray-900 text-white flex items-center justify-center min-h-screen p-4 font-sans">

  <div
    class="text-center p-10 bg-gray-800 rounded-2xl shadow-2xl border border-gray-700 max-w-3xl transform transition duration-500 hover:scale-105">

    <h1
      class="text-5xl md:text-6xl font-extrabold text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-cyan-400 to-blue-600 mb-6 drop-shadow-lg">
      Halo, Fahryan Amadis! 👋
    </h1>

    <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-6 text-gray-200">
      🚀 CI/CD Pipeline Deployment 100% SUKSES!
    </h2>

    <p class="text-gray-400 mb-8 text-lg leading-relaxed">
      Aplikasi web Express.js ini telah berhasil dibangun dan didistribusikan secara otomatis.
